=2 Walkthrough
!King Ranperre's Tomb-map1.jpg|right|King Ranperre's Tomb Map
* Speak to any San d'Orian {n:Gate Guard}, and select "**Bat Hunt**" to begin this Mission.
* Go to (H-11) in {z:East Ronfaure} to zone into {z:King Ranperre's Tomb}.
** If you do not have a map for {z:King Ranperre's Tomb}, one may be purchased from {n:Violitte} - {z:Southern San d'Oria} (G-10) or {n:Elesca} - {z:Northern San d'Oria} (I-8).
* Kill {m:Ding Bats} in {z:King Ranperre's Tomb} (which spawn at night from 18:00 to 6:00) until you receive {@i:Orcish Mail Scales|1112} {i:Orcish Mail Scales|Orcish Mail Scales|1112}.
** This can be done before or after clicking the **Tombstone**.
** There are 2 Bats at the entrance and more around the **Tombstone**.
* Touch the **Tombstone** at (H/I-10) for a cutscene.
** There is a ghost that aggros by it at night if low level. Can just click the **Tombstone** to lose aggro or use {s:sneak|Sneak}.
* Return to a {n:Gate Guard} and trade them the {@i:Orcish Mail Scales|1112} {i:Orcish Mail Scales|Orcish Mail Scales|1112} to complete the Mission.

=2 Repeating
To complete this Mission multiple times for more Ranking Points:
* The {n:Gate Guard} will ask for a {@i:Bat Fang|891} {i:Bat Fang|Bat Fang|891} which can be bought from the {z:Auction House} ({@g:Auction House} > Materials > Bonecraft) or farmed from {m:Mouse Bats|Mouse Bat} in the underground section of {z:King Ranperre's Tomb}.
* Trade the {i:Bat Fang|Bat Fang|891} to the Gate Guard to complete the Mission.
** It is not necessary to zone between multiple trades.

